  (text "Behavior:\nGPIO HIGH -> Q1 ON -> GATE_NODE low -> PMOS ON -> LOAD_OUT powered from +40V.\nGPIO LOW -> Q1 OFF -> R1 pulls gate high -> PMOS OFF.\nD1 clamps PMOS Vgs to a safer 15V class limit.\nSelect a PMOS with at least 60V VDS rating for a real 40V design."
    (at 22.86 124.46 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
    (uuid "10000000-0000-0000-0000-00000000000d")
  )
  (text "Optional parts:\nR4 = 0R/100R gate series resistor for EMI/ringing reduction.\nD2 = flyback diode for inductive loads; populate for motors, relays, and solenoids."
    (at 22.86 154.94 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
    (uuid "10000000-0000-0000-0000-00000000000e")
  )

